# dev/remote.sh smoke-all: one dev/smoke.sh run per line, spread over the
# rig's free slots, and the vm_only legs at the end over the VM rig's
# (dev/vm.sh). Every leg, alone or on the leg it rides. Left out: the
# cameras that write docs/ (shots, screensaver-gif), --r0-measure, which records
# rather than checks, and --installed, which runs a distro image per line.

